# procedurally generated placeholder material -- see Stain_Dirt.obj
# STEP: colors bumped up + a small Ke added. This shader (unlitTexturePS)
# only ever shows Kd*(ambient+light) [+Ke] when there's no texture (Ka/Ks
# aren't actually read by it -- see debris.cpp's comment); in unlit/dark
# corners of the map that meant the old, too-dark Kd rendered as basically
# black. The small Ke keeps it faintly visible as a dusty tone even with
# zero incoming light, without looking like it's glowing.
newmtl DirtStain
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 0.320000 0.260000 0.180000
Ks 0.050000 0.050000 0.050000
Ke 0.050000 0.040000 0.030000
Ns 10.000000
d 1.000000
illum 2
